    "updated_at": "2015-08-10T19:02:35Z",
    "body": "Yes, \"network storage\" is HTTP cache and cookies. \"site storage\" is all APIs (what the Storage Standard lets you make persistent). \"credential storage\" (not listed at the moment) is user credentials. They appear to be all distinct in browsers at the moment.\n",
